cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IMAGINA or ANIMUS in research, cite this repository and the specific study artifacts you used."
title: "IMAGINA: a local-first research platform for mental imagery measurement and scene interaction"
abstract: >-
  IMAGINA is a local-first research platform for mental imagery measurement,
  symbolic scene authoring, and evidence-gated neural research. ANIMUS is the
  product surface. The project separates behavioural measurement from neural
  decoding claims and reports uncertainty, evidence status, and limitations.
  It does not read thoughts or dreams, and it does not provide clinical advice.
